  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "土木工程概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO CIVIL ENGINEERING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程為概論性引介課程。本學期之主要內容乃著重於土木工程領域中結構、大地、建築、水利等學門之基本介紹，賡續提供學生對相關學門與研究之初步了解與進階學習之導引，以培養學生在土木工程的學習與研究之興趣。",
    "describe_eh": "This is an elementary course of civil engineering. The objectives of this course are to introduce various fields of civil engineering, provide fundamental concepts of the structural, geotechnical, architectural, hydraulic engineering etc. and to help students develop interests in civil engineering.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
