    "tpa_score_new": "<div><strong>出席 </strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>Attendance (10%)</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>期中考 </strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>Midterm test (30%)</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>專題海報 </strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>Project Poster (30%)</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>期末專題</strong></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<strong>Final Project (30%)</strong></div>\n",
